[*] --> ViewRealTimeData

ViewRealTimeData --> SetEnergyTargets : User sets targets
SetEnergyTargets --> TrackEnergyUsage : System starts tracking
TrackEnergyUsage --> AlertUser : Usage meets target
AlertUser --> ViewHistoricalData : User views history
